@startuml state-admin-health
!pragma layout smetana
!include ../../../plantuml-style.iuml
title State Machine — Node health in the Auto-Admin (cluster view)

[*] --> UNKNOWN
UNKNOWN --> UP : first heartbeat /\nRegister

UP --> SUSPECT : 1 missed interval
SUSPECT --> UP : heartbeat received
SUSPECT --> DOWN : 3 missed intervals\nAND majority of UP peers suspect
SUSPECT --> UNREACHABLE_FROM_ADMIN : 3 missed intervals\nBUT peers still hear it

UNREACHABLE_FROM_ADMIN --> UP : heartbeat received
UNREACHABLE_FROM_ADMIN --> DOWN : majority of UP peers\nnow suspect it

DOWN --> RECOVERING : Register / heartbeat with\nnew incarnation\n/ record recovery, start repair timer
RECOVERING --> UP : RepairReport(DONE)\n/ record repair time
RECOVERING --> DOWN : 3 missed intervals\nAND peers confirm

UP : routable
SUSPECT : routable
UNREACHABLE_FROM_ADMIN : routable
RECOVERING : routable (accepts writes,\nserves reads)
DOWN : not routable
@enduml
